    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n44793" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εὔπλεκτος</span></b> , 
			Ep.
		
		<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐΰπλ</span>-, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>, also <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">η</span>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>
		<i><span class="en">
			Nonn.
			<u>D.</u>
			13.200
		</span></i> (cj. for <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀπλ-</span>): (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πλέκω</span>):—<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>well-plaited, well-twisted</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σειράς τ᾽ εὐπλέκτους</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Il.
					23.115
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐϋπλέκτῳ ἐνὶ δίφρῳ</span> a
			chariot <i>with sides of wicker</i> or <i>basket-work</i>, ib.
				<i><span class="en">
				335
			</span></i>; of nets, <i><span class="en">
				E.
				<u>Ba.</u>
				870
			</span></i> (lyr.); of hair, <i><span class="en">
				<u>AP</u>
				5.286.6
			</span></i> (<i><span class="en">
				Agath.
			</span></i>).</div>
